<section class="panel" id="kex-generation-runtime" style="margin-top:18px">
<h2>KEDDEH Generation Runtime — Universal Library + Adjacent Worker Fabric</h2>
<p class="note">This generation consumes the existing Universal Software Library model, recurrent IL-LLM continuation rules, Story-First governance, evidence assurance, sector-instantiation discipline and the existing V86/BTC launchpad. Logical workers are work authorities; they are not equated with browser threads.</p>
