<article class="card span4"><div class="label">Worker Unit</div><div class="metric">LOGICAL WORK</div><p class="note">Provider/runtime decides how work executes; fabric decides what work exists and who owns it.</p></article>
<article class="card span4"><div class="label">Continuation</div><div class="metric">RECURRENT</div><p class="note">Task/result lineage persists across adjacent passes and may re-enter valid coordinates without mandatory root restart.</p></article>
